WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.168 --> 00:00:09.312
The Goblin Valley State Park in Utah 

00:00:09.568 --> 00:00:14.000
is known for its thousands of hoodoo rocks, referred to locally as “goblins.”

00:00:14.368 --> 00:00:17.212
Hoodoos are formations of mushroom-shaped sandstone 

00:00:17.368 --> 00:00:21.100
and Goblin Valley has the highest occurrences of these in the world.

00:00:23.168 --> 00:00:26.112
It is often compared to Mars because its look

00:00:26.368 --> 00:00:30.000
is otherworldly.

